  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1: Above seasonal temperatures and rain-free \nconditions will prevail throughout the week. A cold front will \nbring cooler temperatures this weekend.\n\nWith the remnants of Isaias well away from the region, high \npressure will continue to build into the area yielding drier and\nwarmer conditions throughout the week. There's some concern for\nnear record high temperatures a couple days this week (see \nClimate section below). Expect temperatures to range in the mid \nto upper 80s through the end of the work week, before dropping \ninto upper 60s and low 70s this weekend after a cold front \npasses through on Friday night. This will bring significantly \ncooler conditions to region this weekend compared to previous \nseveral days.",
